{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunset Racing\u00a0</strong>is the ultimate casual racing party game, designed to bring the fun with you wherever you go. A top down RC Racing game inspired by classic karting games.\u00a0 With just a Steam Deck, you can challenge a friend, or scale up for epic group races! Inspired by the nostalgia of coffee table arcade cabinets and the excitement of arcades, <strong>Sunset Racing\u00a0</strong>offers multiple control modes to suit any gathering:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Party Mode</strong>: Classic top down RC racing for up to 4 players with 4 controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coffee Table Mode</strong>: Play up to 8 players with only 4 controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobile Device Mode</strong>: Connect to the game via a simple web page controller and play anywhere with WiFi for up to 8 players!*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of tracks and Car Soccer!</strong><br> <br>*Web controller performance depends on network connection stability, the responsiveness may vary.\u00a0 </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958680?t=1757038884","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958680/62e7014bd285078781479c881b4ca158e4f21aa8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757038884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958680/1e450f807c4eab053fcb84ed4d1af449a20ad342/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757038884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958680/1e450f807c4eab053fcb84ed4d1af449a20ad342/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757038884","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Stea